  "description": "Contains outlet pour points for twelve-digit hydrologic unit catchments, derived from NHDPlus V2.1 flow direction rasters, linking each HUC12 to its downstream destination.\n\nMore info can be found at https://doi.org/10.5066/P9SOT2VG\n\nAll features in this dataset derive from the 'usgs:nhdplusv2:huc12pp' sitemap in Geoconnex.\n\nThe source code that generated the RDF data which was transformed into this asset can be found at https://github.com/internetofwater/geoconnex_bulk_runners/tree/main/nhdplusv2:huc12\n\nMainstem association was disabled for this dataset so features will not have an associated Geoconnex mainstem.",
